{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_7","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"printf '%s\\\\n' '--- card ---'; sed -n '1,260p' research/tatqa_wp0_2026/wp1/loop_a_prompt_fix1.md; printf '%s\\\\n' '--- contract section 3/4 ---'; awk 'BEGIN{show=0} /\"'^## 3'\"\\\\./{show=1} /\"'^## 5'\"\\\\./{show=0} show{print}' docs/research/WP0_TATQA_ADAPTER_CHECKER_CONTRACT_v1.md; printf '%s\\\\n' '--- routing excerpt ---'; rg -n \\\"research|verify-before-done|实验|完成\\\" docs/SKILL_ROUTING.md | head -120; printf '%s\\\\n' '--- verify skill ---'; sed -n '1,260p' /home/testuser/.codex/skills/verify-before-done/SKILL.md\"","aggregated_output":"--- card ---\n# Loop A Assignment - TAT-QA WP-1b (bounded fix + completion; NO MODEL CALLS)\n\nCARD: research/tatqa_wp0_2026/wp1/loop_a_prompt_fix1.md | dispatched 2026-10-13 by Loop D after run-1 fail-closed.\nROLE: Loop A / GB10. Bounded completion of WP-1 after run 1 (`tatqa-wp1-20261013`) stopped with `SOFTWARE_NOT_QUALIFIED: hidden_gold_search`. Nothing else. Model calls = 0.\n\nCONTEXT (read first; binding):\n- Revision 1.1 in `docs/research/WP0_TATQA_ADAPTER_CHECKER_CONTRACT_v1.md` Sec.4 SUPERSEDES Sec.3 obligation 2 only. Run-1 diagnosis: the check searched `late_value`/`early_value` (actor-visible table cells by design) inside the projection -> guaranteed false positive; the fail-closed stop was correct behaviour.\n- Run-1 artifacts remain in `research/tatqa_wp0_2026/wp1/`; do not delete them (extend where the fix requires).\n- Pinned inputs unchanged; re-verify the four hashes and the two counts before running (same as run 1).\n\nTASK (bounded):\n1. Update `_check_hidden_gold_search` in `run_fixtures.py` to revision 1.1:\n   (a) forbidden-name search as before;\n   (b) boundary-aware search for the `delta_source` and `delta_target` strings (as the checker renders them) across the FULL serialized projection for EVERY fixture - zero matches required; flanking characters outside {digits, `.`, `,`, `+`, `-`}; no length filter;\n   (c) exclude `late_value`/`early_value` from the search set;\n   (d) verify the fixture-design precondition per fixture (same boundary-aware search over raw table cells and period labels alone); if a collision exists, adjust ONLY the synthetic fixture numbers (keep the arithmetic correct).\n2. Keep every other check and module unchanged. If the updated suite reveals any other genuine failure, stop and report it - do not weaken anything.\n3. Re-run `python3 research/tatqa_wp0_2026/wp1/run_fixtures.py`. On PASS emit:\n   - `research/tatqa_wp0_2026/wp1/PREFLIGHT_RECEIPT.json`\n   - `data/research/tatqa_wp0_2026/wp1/FIXTURE_RECEIPT.json`\n   - `research/tatqa_wp0_2026/wp1/WP1_RECEIPT.json`\n   (schemas: per-obligation results, artifact hashes for checker/adapter/provenance/run_fixtures/fixtures/contract/preflight, cost model_calls=0, unverified items, deviations; run id `tatqa-wp1b-20261013`.)\n4. Update `implementation_contract.md` with a revision addendum (corrected check + run-2 artifacts) and refresh `implementation_contract.sha256`; update the hash pins in `PREREG_DRAFT_SKELETON.md`.\n5. Same write paths and forbidden list as run 1: no model/judge calls, no network, no services, no training, no commit/push, no edits to paper/, docs/, or pinned inputs, no candidate-item scoring (fixtures are synthetic).\n\nSTOP CONDITIONS: any genuine obligation failure -> `SOFTWARE_NOT_QUALIFIED` naming the failing item (never adjust a test to pass); hash mismatch -> `HASH_MISMATCH`; a forbidden action being required -> stop and report.\n\nEND: final message = status + receipt paths + one-line summary.\n--- contract section 3/4 ---\n## 3. Fixture obligations (what Loop A must demonstrate without any model)\n\nOn synthetic fixtures only, Loop A must show:\n1. the adapter emits the same prompt twice for the same item (byte equality);\n2. the gold never appears in the projection (string search);\n3. the checker's recomputation matches hand-computed values on at least 5 hand-built fixtures, including one with parentheses-negative cells and one with a thousands separator;\n4. the scale conversion matches for thousand->unit, million->thousand, billion->million and percent->percent;\n5. an `UNKNOWN` and a `REFUSED` answer are classified correctly;\n6. the arm-context token delta between E and C is computed and reported.\n\n**Stop:** if any fixture obligation cannot be met, WP-1 stops and reports `SOFTWARE_NOT_QUALIFIED`. No model is called to \"try it out\".\n\n## 4. Revision 1.1 (2026-10-13): hidden-gold search clarified\n\n**Trigger:** WP-1 run 1 (`tatqa-wp1-20261013`) stopped fail-closed with `SOFTWARE_NOT_QUALIFIED: hidden_gold_search`. Diagnosis: the check searched `late_value` and `early_value` (fields of the `expected_gold` object) inside the projection. Those are raw table cells that the actor must read to compute the delta, so the search necessarily hits the table itself - a false-positive class, not a leak. The fail-closed stop was correct behaviour; the check definition, as written, was over-broad and undecidable.\n\n**Revision (supersedes Sec.3 obligation 2 only; every other obligation is unchanged):**\n\n(a) Forbidden-name search: none of the hidden field names (`gold_delta_source_unit`, `gold_recompute_rule`, `gold_delta_target_unit`, `expected_gold`, `origin_id`, `item_id`) appears in the projection.\n(b) Answer-value search: the derived answer strings - `delta_source` and `delta_target` exactly as the checker renders them (for example `60`, `-55`, `1.3`, `1300`) - have ZERO boundary-aware matches in the full serialized projection. A match counts only when flanked on both sides by characters outside the set {digits, `.`, `,`, `+`, `-`} (string start/end count as a boundary). No length filter; applies to EVERY fixture.\n(c) `late_value` and `early_value` are excluded from the search set: they are actor-visible task inputs by design, not gold.\n(d) Fixture-design precondition (makes (b) informative rather than vacuous): for every fixture, the same boundary-aware search over the raw table cells and period labels alone must also find zero matches; if a collision exists, the fixture's synthetic numbers must be adjusted (keeping the arithmetic correct) - never the check.\n\n**Change control:** this revision does not weaken (a)-(d); it makes the search well-defined and extends its scope to all fixtures. Any further failure of this obligation after this revision is a genuine finding.\n--- routing excerpt ---\n10:| 论文线 | research-writing-skill / algorithm-description / paper-review-check / paper-polish-and-audit / scientific-toolkit-skill | graph-loop-rules |\n13:| 前端线 | playwright / frontend-quality / verify-before-done | graph-loop-rules |\n15:| 交付线 | office-academic-skill / pdf / verify-before-done | graph-loop-rules |\n16:| 调研/决策线 | inquiry-methods / socrates / paper-review-check / research-driven-design / decision-record | graph-loop-rules |\n30:| verification-before-completion | **已废（DEPRECATED 标记）** | 已并入 verify-before-done（对抗式审查 + 完成门两段式, 2026-07-28 合并）; 新任务一律装后者 |\n39:| 09-21 批 #8-A 的 10 簇合并 | **10 簇合并已执行（用户 09-21 裁定）** | C1 research-writing-skill(合 paper-writing-zh) / C2 experiment-analysis(合 experiment-observer) / C3 commit-and-pr-hygiene(3) / C4 code-simplification(3) / C5 git-history-ops(3) / C6 db-schema-change(2) / C7 frontend-quality(3) / C8 testing-practices(4) / C12 progress-reading-protocol(合 broken-window-check) / C13 eval-harness(合 evaluator-calibration); 目录 108→92, A 93→77, C 21→21 |\n52:| 实验窗开/收 | sprint-contract + verify-before-done | 窗口卡标配两件 |\n60:| formal experiment preflight | verify-before-done + audit-cycle + self-eval-bias | `FORMAL_EXPERIMENT_PREFLIGHT_V1.md`; END_TO_END_PREFLIGHT_PASS 前禁止 scientific output |\n--- verify skill ---\n---\nname: verify-before-done\ndescription: |\n  说\"完成/修复/通过/绿了\"之前的强制验收门（合并自 adversarial-verify + verification-before-completion，2026-07-28）。\n  两段式：① 对抗式审查——假设代码是坏的，按 11 条\"假完成\"捷径清单找茬；② 完成门——本轮实跑验证命令、读全输出后才允许宣称成功。\n  触发时机：任何完成申报前、commit/交接前、验收 remote server agent\"全部完成\"汇报时、给 user 报实验结论前。\n---\n\n# Verify Before Done：完成申报前的双重验收\n\n> 本域血泪案例（为什么这个 skill 必须触发）：\n> - 1500 步观察曾报\"观察线严格未触发（2 段）\"，重算全序列实为 **5 段连爬**——只看尾部数据就下了全局结论（HANDOFF 07-27 修正条目）\n> - baseline_v1 训练\"loss 3.547→0.197、0 错误\"看起来完美，实际是 uu_sim→0.99 的**退化解** + last_pos bug 双缺陷\n> - 铁律呼应：`project-memory.md`\"助手'全部完成'汇报需逐项核对勾选状态\"；\"修好一个真实 bug ≠ 解释了观察到的异常\"\n\n## 第一段：对抗式审查（假设它是坏的）\n\n默认立场：**代码/结论是坏的，直到证明不是。** 不客气、不提修复方案、只找茬。\n先读目标 spec（Goal Card / 任务描述）：「完成」到底要求什么？再逐行读 diff。\n\n### 11 条\"假完成\"捷径清单（逐条过）\n\n1. **放松测试** — 断言被削弱或删除，红变绿\n2. **吞掉错误** — try/except 把失败藏起来而不是处理\n3. **假改名** — 函数换个名就算\"修了\"，行为没变\n4. **桩返回值** — 硬编码返回值骗过单个测试\n5. **注释当修复** — bug 变成了 TODO\n6. **只走 happy path** — 空输入/缺文件/异常分支没处理\n7. **范围蔓延** — 与目标无关的\"顺手改\"\n8. **发明 API** — 调用了源码里不存在的方法/参数\n9. **静默决策** — 架构级选择（schema/采样方式）没有上报就做了\n10. **mock 骗过** — 测试 mock 掉了它声称要验证的那个东西\n11. **偏题完成** — 代码能跑、测试通过，但解决的不是要求的目标\n\n**输出**（JSON，不写散文）：`{\"passes\": false, \"failures\": [{\"line\": 42, \"shortcut\": \"吞掉错误\", \"why\": \"...\"}]}`\n真过了就一句话说明；大多数时候过不了。\n\n## 第二段：完成门（本轮实跑验证）\n\n```\n没有本轮新鲜验证证据，禁止任何完成申报\n```\n\n宣称 \"done / fixed / 通过 / 绿了\" 之前的门函数：\n\n1. **定位** — 哪条命令能证明这个声明？\n2. **实跑** — 本轮完整执行它\n3. **读全** — 完整输出 + 退出码 + 失败计数\n4. **核对** — 输出真的支持声明吗？\n5. **然后才** — 带着证据做声明\n\n### 常见虚假声明 → 实际需要什么\n\n| 声明 | 需要 | 不算数 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 测试通过 | 本轮跑测试，exit 0，0 失败 | \"应该能过\"、上次的运行结果 |\n| bug 修好了 | 复现原症状，亲眼看它不再发生 | 改了代码、\"按理说修了\" |\n| 训练健康 | 守卫指标（uu_sim 分布形态/pos_sim/margin），不只 loss | \"loss 降得很好\"（v1 教训：loss 0.197 是退化解） |\n| 助手/子 agent 完成 | 亲自读 diff / log，核对声称的改动真实存在 | 对方自己的\"success\"汇报 |\n| 数字结论 | 写明来源 log 路径 + 全序列/全分片核算 | 只看尾部/单 rank 数据外推全局 |\n| 验证命令\"无输出=干净\" | 先用**已知正例**证明该命令真的能检出，再信它的空输出 | 空集二义：\"干净\"和\"没匹配上\"是同一个输出；git pathspec/glob 是 cwd 相对的，换个目录命中集可以静默变空（前缀抽样假绿：报 179 实际 591） |\n| \"规则/立法说 X\" | 打开规则载体 grep 原文 | commit message、回执、他人转述里\"声称规则已立\"——声称不是载体 |\n\n### 红旗词（出现即说明你正要跳过验证）\n\n\"should / probably / 应该 / 看起来没问题 / 大概率\" · 跑命令前就写\"Done!/完美\" · 信任子 agent 的自报成功 · \"就这一次\" · 部分验证外推整体（linter 过了 ≠ build 过） · 凭记忆引用规则/数字不查载体 · 验证命令零输出直接当\"全干净\"\n\n## 何时触发（If-Then，已注册进协作协议 §五）\n\n- 任何\"完成/修复/通过\"表述前（含心里想的）\n- git commit、任务勾选、交接 HANDOFF 前\n- 验收 remote server agent汇报时（逐项核对，不转述其结论）\n- 向 user 报实验数字前（数字必须可溯源到 log 路径）\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
